  "ruleText": "Par 102.04 \"Inmate\" means any adult committed by law to the custody of the commissioner.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Par 102) #5685, eff 8-16-93; ss by #7070, INTERIM, eff 8-12-99, EXPIRES: 12-10-99; ss and moved by #7148, eff 12-7-99 (formerly Par 101.04); ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17 (from Par 102.03)",
